# nexora-action-code: get_mac_table
Value Required VLAN (\S+)
Value Required MAC_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value Required TYPE (\S+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Vlan\s+Mac\s+Address\s+Type\s+Ports\s*$$ -> Rows
  ^.*

Rows
  ^\s*-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s*$$
  ^\s*${VLAN}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${TYPE}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*Total\s+Mac\s+Addresses(?:\s+for\s+this\s+criterion)?:\s+\d+\s*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*

EOF
